<title>UK: IBM unit sets 200 mln mark 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>IBM unit sets 200 mln mark 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p> BORROWER   IBM INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DMK   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    28.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.355   PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.605    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
